sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as React or Flutter Customer/Courier
    participant G as Google SDK/provider
    participant Y as YARP
    participant I as Identity API
    participant DB as Identity DB
    U->>C: Choose Google sign-in
    C->>G: SDK sign-in with configured client
    alt User cancels or provider fails
        G-->>C: Cancel/error
        C-->>U: No SwiftDrop session
    else SDK returns ID token
        G-->>C: Google ID token
        C->>Y: POST /api/v1/auth/google (GoogleLogin)
        Y->>I: Forward idToken
        I->>I: Validate signature issuer audience expiry CSRF/nonce
        alt Invalid/unverifiable token
            I-->>C: 401 / no mutation
        else Valid token
            I->>DB: Resolve provider + subject, check active user
            alt Existing linked active user
                DB-->>I: Existing identity and roles
            else No subject and no local email collision
                I->>DB: Atomic Customer + external identity
            else Local email collision or disabled account
                I-->>C: Reject / account_link_required
                Note over I,DB: No automatic email merge, LinkGoogle requires local reauthentication
            end
            opt Eligible active identity resolved
                I->>DB: Persist hashed refresh session
                I-->>C: 200 app JWT and client-appropriate refresh storage
                C-->>U: Open role-authorized experience
            end
        end
    end
